    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79523" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρεφεδρεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lie near to guard : keep guard</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν Σικελίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2.24.13
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PAmh.</u>
				2.36.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
